# Data Display (Log Query Tool)

A browser-based log query tool built with FastAPI, DuckDB, and Monaco Editor.

## Features
- Query JSON logs using SQL
- Interactive browser-based query editor
- Tabular results display

## Tech Stack
- FastAPI
- DuckDB
- Pandas
- Monaco Editor

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app:app --reload

open in browser http://127.0.0.1:8000
